  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiscal policy</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Pol&#xed;tica fiscal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Alentar y ayudar a los pa&#xed;ses a aplicar pol&#xed;ticas fiscales sostenibles y eficientes, que consisten en establecer estructuras de ingresos y gastos y desarrollar t&#xe9;cnicas de gesti&#xf3;n que permitan a un gobierno gestionar la econom&#xed;a mediante la expansi&#xf3;n y contracci&#xf3;n del gasto p&#xfa;blico. Todo el apoyo a la pol&#xed;tica fiscal debe descentralizarse al nivel apropiado de gobierno y tratar de eliminar el potencial de corrupci&#xf3;n.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Encourage and help countries to apply sustainable and efficient fiscal policies, which consist of establishing revenue and expenditure structures and develop management techniques that allow a government to manage the economy through the expansion and contraction of government spending. All support for fiscal policy should be decentralized to the appropriate level of government, and seek to eliminate the potential for corruption.</narrative>
  </description>
